{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>粉嶺靈山村今日（29日）凌晨發生火警，一名男子被發現倒斃現場，身份有待警方查證。有村民指涉事單位經常有大量電動單車充電，事發時聽到「霹靂啪啦電池爆炸聲」，村民甚至懷疑火警是電動單車的電池着火。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防員在起火單位調查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159070300285964288510246.jpeg/A1vpVxhlz-3aMFDHVCC5SstWIjoUYqrFSrzQ3W-80N0\"/><figcaption>消防員在起火單位調查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><p>住在起火單位毗鄰的陳小姐，火警期間熟睡中。她憶述說：「聽到霹靂啪啦電池爆炸聲，起身望出去見到着了火，好大煙。」她表示與該住戶不相熟，但見過其單位內有很多電動單車的電池在充電，因此懷疑：「應該係電動車的電池着火」。</p><p>她無奈說：「危險呀！但都做唔到啲咩。」她現時未能回家，消防員告知其單位亦被波及損毀。</p><figure><img alt=\"居民劉先生與父母走火警。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159073317383049216830214.jpeg/06N-Y_I0r55lAY82wd4IC6YFW1d199H6rP5vqon-b6o\"/><figcaption>居民劉先生與父母走火警。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><p>另一位居民劉先生與父母及時逃生，大叫「好好彩」，他亦指見過起火單位有電動單車，但與該住戶並不相熟。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場射水灌救。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159055510792572928609735.jpeg/nUrUKPAcZ3ABkIMga2ZnT-9eVRO9HF7PTn5CA05-QgM\"/><figcaption>消防員在場射水灌救。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場射水灌救。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159055513049239552684157.jpeg/DXBGblgAVX-vHqVzZBzupx947KB9VGYz9jSVxfY0lcU\"/><figcaption>消防員在場射水灌救。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有村民走火警。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159055515222020096750386.jpeg/CLSi5IT2mXsJC7Sk_f2ss1G-heRx92prn8BqhJ_AaoQ\"/><figcaption>有村民走火警。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><p>由居民提供的片段可見，火警期間鐵皮屋一片通紅，消防員入村拖喉射水。</p><figure><img alt=\"彭太與丈夫和家姑逃出。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159066459280773120293506.jpeg/o51-JactHY5QN5BUUgPDPMpKYCBuq9_2zaL73s2i-94\"/><figcaption>彭太與丈夫和家姑逃出。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"彭老太95歲，由兒子推輪椅走火警。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159066462976086016685974.jpeg/-r0NMOEJ8OlmV_mlC_tQ6S0aSQnTkSfMOQpg9jkKYPY\"/><figcaption>彭老太95歲，由兒子推輪椅走火警。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"居民匆匆收拾細軟走火警。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159073958805377024280135.jpeg/u0D8T1SnYci6x7yH6kpPaKQPNKB_PckZSJ-z922fs_c\"/><figcaption>居民匆匆收拾細軟走火警。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在起火單位內調查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159074752229281792548062.jpeg/4jP7fVYOJDQFLchRndsemFJysm2Qs0RplWUL1rBlC9Y\"/><figcaption>消防員在起火單位內調查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在起火單位內調查。（蔡正邦攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159074754926350336581392.jpeg/DGdj9AeVDbNzG3gZkV_jGh-68YGgTIK46RJtd8wSbXc\"/><figcaption>消防員在起火單位內調查。（蔡正邦攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159060936519061504806539.jpeg/xAyoD7XupMMT4dzcBAJD5toIVIcSqlyxwnSu48J0ruM\"/><figcaption>火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159060940067573760732108.jpeg/8dPO267DCM0l3uvz_OqyhfOGxjjJAXxuu_jQrLv40Kw\"/><figcaption>火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159060943515422720026958.jpeg/bvlqGVVZlur6OXCIsyF1w6-ALFZqMfA14tBl7uLQZe4\"/><figcaption>火警期間現場冒出熊熊烈火。（讀者提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警熄滅後仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159057010294263808954801.jpeg/oiXkUJQKQaTAuULWyCW5k7wHy755dBCj6lEoVMBRKFQ\"/><figcaption>火警熄滅後仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><p>火警發生於今日（29日）凌晨4時31分，靈山村一間鐵皮屋起火。消防員到場出動一條喉和一隊煙帽隊灌救，約49分鐘後將火救熄；其間36男42女，與及一批貓狗疏散到安全地方。至清晨6時26分，警方指，一名男子被發現當場不治，警方正調查死者身份及致死原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場灌救。（Facebook「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159040227310833664372514.jpeg/6dTETl_OX7yWOP7e5HZHboIBzxQ6cyTOmoSzBpqEswY\"/><figcaption>消防員在場灌救。（Facebook「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場灌救。（Facebook「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」影片截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159040229634609152216840.jpeg/WD4AElrhWk3_vQy_VB6LdWT_cboiBys7pi81_6YvNf8\"/><figcaption>消防員在場灌救。（Facebook「北區之友 Friends of North District (上水、粉嶺、沙頭角和打鼓嶺)」影片截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員救出一隻貓。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159049909794508800680315.jpeg/YjxAxXF-f5yhDzn6I1CnIC1OIJ0sgMn7PlDedz5Q3nc\"/><figcaption>消防員救出一隻貓。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有寵物獲救。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159049330259136512021587.jpeg/NzSHGoUQZLGhDqbGobaUENrmcnJh_qS3GPAtRxjwLUc\"/><figcaption>有寵物獲救。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159048723960172544634287.jpeg/E_Q7zNlDJy_tePU-kE0qilCOmKaKRNHrPb9EMj2_RDI\"/><figcaption>現場仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159048726145536000518604.jpeg/-yHW5BRu9nnKFzOPTr0ZlJGRdwYb77TSczZ9EnM2fRI\"/><figcaption>現場仍然冒出白煙。（陳巧恩攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"居民疏散到路德會社區服務處休息。（彭紹殷攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260729/1159063254442446848702569.jpeg/VWNt6f6BKoYoF0wxJnMpmt8B0auizQct1KqaOtSqmjo\"/><figcaption>居民疏散到路德會社區服務處休息。（彭紹殷攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-29T02:38:31.893532+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":944,"images":21,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}